  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financing for Ruta 10 Paraguay - Lote 2 - Consorcio Avanza Ruta 10</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ruta PY10 Lot 2 Project involves the construction of a 67&#x2011;km section of National Route PY10 in Paraguay, executed under a public works contract awarded by the Ministry of Public Works and Communications to Consorcio Avanza Ruta 10. The project represents an investment of approximately USD 80 million, with an estimated construction period of 24 months. The contractual structure is based on monthly work certifications paid by the Government of Paraguay, complemented by the issuance of U.S. dollar&#x2011;indexed interest&#x2011;bearing certificates upon completion of defined functional units. IDB Invest proposes to participate through a combination of a working capital facility during construction and a securities purchase facility linked to these certificates.</narrative>
  </description>
